    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Aura of Hospitality",
      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "aura",
        "emotion",
        "mental"
      ],
      "text": "60 feet. The faydhaan shuyookh dissuades those around them from hostility. Willing creatures in the emanation gain a +2 status bonus to Society and Diplomacy checks. The shuyookh can suppress or resume the aura as a free action. If the shuyookh acts hostile, the aura deactivates and can't be reactivated for 1 hour. When any other creature in the aura acts hostile, it must attempt a DC 35 Will save save. On a success, it's unaffected and doesn't need to save again for 1 hour; on a failure, its current action is disrupted, as are any other hostile actions it attempts for 1 round.",
      "rules": [
